Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.01,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Aqui é a Pixelzada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:22.77,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Neste vídeo a gente atravessa o mapa de GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.30,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ponta a ponta: a cidade, as praias, as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:27.65,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ilhas, o pântano e até a tal montanha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:30.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E em cada parada eu te mostro o que a Rockstar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:32.51,Legenda,,0,0,0,,copiou da vida real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:34.78,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se você vai jogar no lançamento, já se
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:37.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,inscreve, porque essa semana o canal vai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:37.71,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ferver.
