Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.78,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Até agora, a Rockstar mostrou seis regiões.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:35.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vice City, a capital do neon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:38.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Leonida Keys, o colar de ilhas no sul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:40.32,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Grassrivers, o pântano.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.34,0:01:42.83,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Port Gellhorn, na costa do Golfo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:44.60,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ambrosia, no interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:47.95,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E o Mount Kalaga, um parque nacional no norte.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:49.67,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Vamos uma por uma.
