Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:21.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Miami é conhecida como a capital mundial dos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.12,0:02:24.58,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cruzeiros, e Vice City tem porto, iate, lancha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:26.57,Legenda,,0,0,0,,e jet ski para todo lado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:29.17,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Os prédios espelhados do centro, as pontes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:31.89,Legenda,,0,0,0,,ligando a cidade à praia, as festas na beira
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:32.47,Legenda,,0,0,0,,do mar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:35.36,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Quem já viu Miami de perto vai reconhecer a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:36.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade em segundos.
