Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:40.60,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Descendo para o sul, chegamos em Leonida Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.62,0:02:43.51,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Na vida real, as Florida Keys são uma corrente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.43,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de ilhas ligadas por uma única estrada sobre o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:49.22,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mar, a Overseas Highway, com quarenta e duas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:49.82,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pontes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:52.42,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Uma delas tem quase onze quilômetros.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:55.65,Legenda,,0,0,0,,É água azul-turquesa dos dois lados, barco de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:58.81,Legenda,,0,0,0,,pesca, bar de praia e muita gente fugindo da
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:02:59.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,cidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:02.37,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Nos trailers, essa vibe aparece em festa em
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:05.07,Legenda,,0,0,0,,barco, passeio de lancha e areia branca.
