Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:36.04,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Do outro lado do estado, na costa do Golfo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:37.50,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fica Port Gellhorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:40.45,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se Vice City é o cartão-postal, Port Gellhorn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:42.48,Legenda,,0,0,0,,é a praia que ficou para trás.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:45.44,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Cidade portuária, motel de beira de estrada,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:48.52,Legenda,,0,0,0,,casa noturna com letreiro piscando e bem menos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:49.21,Legenda,,0,0,0,,glamour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:51.79,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Tudo indica que a inspiração vem do norte da
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:54.25,Legenda,,0,0,0,,costa do Golfo da Flórida, a região que os
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:56.11,Legenda,,0,0,0,,americanos chamam de Panhandle.
